EZ130 8T V1.1
Copyright 2026 ETH Zurich

The EZ130 8T library was created as part of the ``VLSI 5: Design of a
Standard-Cell Library'' course from ETH Zurich during its first,
spring 2025 offering. Its contributors are:

Oscar Castaneda
Lavinia Recchioni
Tobias Senti
Flurin Cahenzli
Marco Ferroni
