Beat Muheim
Arianna Rubino
Jeremy Guichemerre
Frank K. Gurkaynak
Christoph Studer

The EZ130 8T library authors thank Cadence Design Systems for their
generous support by providing licenses to design and characterize
this standard-cell library.

The most recent version of the EZ130 8T library is available at:
https://ez.ethz.ch

If you use the EZ130 8T library (or parts of it),
then please cite this reference:

